{
  "sequence_id": "seq_fa5b05d0f22bff15",
  "texts": [
    {
      "id": "PG1:T1",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "A suspended sentence?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T2",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "So... it's on hold for now?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T3",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Yup."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T4",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Rust"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T5",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Kosh: Just"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T6",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Rust."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T7",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Let me explain from the top."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T8",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "This is the same as the cursed object you ate."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T9",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "There're 20 in all."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T10",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "We're in possession of six."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T11",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "twenty? Oh, count- ing both fingers and toes."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T12",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Nope, Sukuna has four arms."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T13",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Toss"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T14",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "OM!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T15",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "No"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T16",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "!!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T17",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "As you can see..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T1",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "...you can't destroy them."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T2",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "It's that powerful of a curse."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T3",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "with each passing day, they get even stronger."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T4",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Dops, I made a hole in the wall"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T5",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "We actually don't have anyone that can seal them properly right now."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T6",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "that's where YOU come in."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T7",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "If you die..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T8",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "...the curse inside you, Sukuna, will die as well!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T9",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Our elders are cowards."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T10",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "They're making a fuss about killing you right away."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T11",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "But that would be a waste, right?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T12",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "A WASTE?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T13",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "There's no guarantee that a vessel capable of controlling sukuna will ever come around again."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T14",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "So this was my proposal ..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T1",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "\"If we're gonna kill him..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T2",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "...why not kill him after he consume the rest of sukuna?\""
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T3",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "The higher- ups agreed."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T4",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "So now you have two options..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T5",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "die now, or..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T6",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "...Find the remaining parts of sukuna..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T7",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "...and die after taking them all into your body."
    }
  ],
